{"description":"Un equipo multitasking y multidisciplinario destinados al éxito y dispuestos a aprender lo necesario para cumplir su objetivo final.","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/122901.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"Our project is an interactive web platform that centralizes and analyzes scientific information about combustion and fire behavior in space. It integrates an SI-powered assistant connected to NASA scientific repositories, interactive data visualizations, and a 3D flame simulation.\nThe platform addresses the difficulty of accessing and interpreting scattered scientific data by allowing users to ask technical questions and receive structured, evidence-based answers supported by references to original research. Its simulation also allows users to explore how flames behave under different gravity and atmospheric conditions.\nThis project is important because understanding combustion in microgravity is essential for spacecraft fire safety. By making complex scientific information more accessible, the platform aims to support researchers, improve knowledge of fire behavior in space, and contribute to safer future space missions.","details":"<p>Documents:</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DubbRFkBym6NYxcfciUHWsslD4rXgKun?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FireSpace GX</a></p><p>Repositorys:</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/IsHectron/FireSpaceGX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Spanish Version</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/anmaribaphomet/FireSpaceGX-English\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">English Version</a></p><p>Site Spanish Version</p><p><a href=\"https://firespace-esp.jimaxo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://firespace-esp.jimaxo.com/ </a></p>","dataRefs":[["PSI-68","https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-68"],["PSI-10","https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-10"],["PSI-100","https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/